              <li><strong>{"Ask for Wholeness, Not Just a Fix"}</strong> {" "}{"The difference between healing and wholeness is the difference between treating a symptom and restoring an entire identity. Jesus did not just stop her bleeding. He called her daughter. He gave her back her name. When you pray, do not ask for money when you need time. Do not ask for relief when you need to be remade. Ask for the root healing, the kind that makes you whole in every part of yourself, the kind that changes how you see yourself and how others see you."}</li>
